  "description": "*Please send all enquires via Daft only*\n\nRowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers are delighted to present this beautifully maintained one bedroom apartment located on Newham Street, right in the heart of Limerick City Centre. The apartment is fully furnished and is tastefully decorated throughout and offers a welcoming, homely feel from the moment you step inside.\n\nKey Features:\n•\tSpacious double bedroom with ample built-in storage\n•\tContemporary bathroom featuring a sleek finish and electric shower\n•\tOpen-plan kitchen/living area.\n•\tModern furnishings throughout with stylish, neutral decor\n•\tExcellent city centre location – walking distance to shops, restaurants, public transport and all city amenities.\n•\tPrepay Meter. \n•\tGas Central Heating- Used at peak times. \n•\tRefuse collection included in rent. \n•\tOn street parking. \n\nThis property offers a rare combination of modern living in a prime urban setting. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\n*We invite tenant CV’s from Homehak*\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars and terms are provided by Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers with the understanding that all negotiations regarding the mentioned property must be conducted exclusively through them. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information provided, Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the particulars or any representations made about the property. The details in this brochure do not form any part of a contract. Prospective purchasers or lessees are advised to independently verify all details to their satisfaction. Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers shall not be held responsible for any loss or expenses incurred in visiting the property, including but not limited to instances where the property is found to be unsuitable, already sold, let, or withdrawn from the market.  \n",
